WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
Set up the camera
Keep the lens near eye level.
Use soft light from the front.

00:06.000 --> 00:12.000
Keep the face visible
Face the lens; leave headroom.
Keep your mouth unobstructed.

00:12.000 --> 00:18.000
Video: 30–120 seconds
Mouth closed for the first second.
Then speak normally; stay in frame.

00:18.000 --> 00:24.000
Choose a natural portrait
One person, eyes and mouth clear.
Relaxed lips; no heavy filters.

00:24.000 --> 00:30.000
Likeness + authorization
Read the wording shown in Kali.
Try a short script when ready.
